cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below and link to the page the data comes from."
type: dataset
title: "Written in Bitcoin: open data on data written into Bitcoin and on quantum-exposed bitcoin"
authors:
  - name: "Written in Bitcoin"
    website: "https://writteninbitcoin.com"
abstract: >-
  Weekly tables computed on a full Bitcoin Core node: unspent bitcoin with a visible public key by output type and by
  year of creation, and the bytes written into Bitcoin blocks per year since 2009 by channel (miners' messages,
  OP_RETURN, data hidden in keys and addresses, Counterparty, Ordinals, Bitcoin Stamps, Atomicals, Runes and other
  envelopes).
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://writteninbitcoin.com/en/in-numbers"
repository: "https://github.com/SpdVpr/written-in-bitcoin-data"
keywords:
  - Bitcoin
  - blockchain data
  - UTXO set
  - quantum computing
  - P2PK
  - Taproot
  - block space
  - OP_RETURN
  - Ordinals
  - inscriptions
  - Runes
